ls-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2018-08-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Rowe","x":"And then on the back of the steel import tariffs, at the end of Q1, we did our second price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/09/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2018-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Rowe","x":"And just as a reminder, from what we talked about in Q1, and so we've actually done two price increases at the beginning of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/09/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2018-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Rowe","x":"We started to feel little bit better at the market, and so we did a relatively kind of across the board price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/09/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2018-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Rowe","x":"Additionally, we are aggressively pursuing our transformational strategy to drive operational excellence, reduce complexity, accelerate growth, and streamline Flowserve's operating model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/09/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2018-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lee Eckert","x":"On a reported basis, our gross margin increased 140 basis points to 29.4% on volume leverage, cost savings, ASC 606 and lower adjusting item charges versus prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/09/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2018-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lee Eckert","x":"Turning to our 2018 outlook, with our first half results roughly in line with our expectations, we remain on pace for our full year and reaffirm our guidance including the adjusted EPS target range of $1.50 to $1.70 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/09/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2018-11-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Rowe","x":"And so let me start with inflation, I'll hit tariffs, but on the inflation side, we are seeing inflation on the material and on labor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/08/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2018-11-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Rowe","x":"And then on the tariff side, we are being impacted, but what I'd say is, it's a relatively small number for all of Flowserve.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/08/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2018-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Rowe","x":"They are ahead on the price curve side, we've got price increases that really took hold earlier in the year, and then the facilities for the most part are operating at a pretty high level.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/08/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2018-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Rowe","x":"And then on the pricing side, if you remember, we did two early price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/08/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2018-11-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lee Eckert","x":"The increase was primarily related to enabling technology investments as part of our Flowserve 2.0, as well as some increased spending on ongoing restructuring initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/08/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2019-02-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lee S. Eckert","x":"It's as I discussed before, we did several price increases at the beginning of '18, which offset the inflation in tariffs and other headwinds that we had in the global environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2019-02-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lee S. Eckert","x":"What I would say is, it's still a volatile environment in terms of tariffs and trade and things like that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2019-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lee S. Eckert","x":"Now as we switch to pricing for 2019, we announced our price increase actually in December of last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2019-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lee S. Eckert","x":"And so, we're going to be pretty aggressive on the pricing side as -- again as evidence that we've already announced our price increase and we're locked in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lee S. Eckert","x":"We continue to pursue IT investments in the quarter that support and enable our Flowserve 2.0 agenda, we continue to invest in various growth and restructuring initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2018 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"While we do expect to drive modest cost savings as a result, the real catalyst for the combination is to drive productivity and value for our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2019-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lee S. Eckert","x":"So we feel very good about where we are on price right now relative to cost, inflation, tariffs and everything else, but there are areas of concern and where it's say the -- the areas are primarily the larger projects and for some reason, larger projects attract more attention, and what we're…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2019-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"And then in addition to that, the backdrop of tariffs and cost inflation, also give us the ability to have true and honest discussions with our customers to say, hey, here's the real environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2019-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"We are seeing good results from our price increases that went into effect at the beginning of the year, and we are pleased with the acceptance and resiliency that we've seen thus far.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2019-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"We have initiated further price increases over the last few months, where we have the opportunity to price at higher levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2019-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"Our associates are leading the Flowserve 2.0 effort to accelerate growth, reduce complexity, and streamline the Flowserve operating model, and we are making great progress.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2019-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lee S. Eckert","x":"In addition to that, what we've done in the engineered order as we started to raise our margin expectations, as we've been able to drive cost out in the execution instead of passing that on to the customers we're capturing that ourselves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"So we actually started in December, and we did a second price increase kind of late Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/21/flowserve-corp-fls-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"And what I'd say is it's a combination of tariff and inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"So just as a reminder we did 2 pretty significant price increases in 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"And so we're focused on that but we're probably more focused on how do we take cost out to make sure that we're not eroding too much margin there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"We are definitely seeing cost savings right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2020-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"We continue to target significant opportunities to drive further margin improvement through lean focus productivity initiatives, design-to-value product cost reduction, improved manufacturing planning, supply chain management and G&A cost control.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2019 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2020-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"I will also add that the realignment spending in 2020, the vast majority of that would be headcount reductions rather than major facility move.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2020-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"We are planning $100 million of cost reductions within 2020 as compared to the prior year with a similar cost reduction number on a run rate basis entering 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2020-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"We also plan to substantially reduce capital expenditures to below $60 million, deliver greater supply chain savings, and we'll continue to rightsize our workforce to current market conditions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2020-05-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"In April, we withdrew our full year guidance due to the rapidly changing environment and the limited long-term visibility.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Rowe","x":"Our second quarter results demonstrate our ability to persevere through the COVID crisis, take swift and material cost reduction actions, and leverage the great work from the Flowserve 2.0 transformation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/01/flowserve-corp-fls-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amy Schwetz","x":"The largest adjusted item included in our reported numbers was $0.40 of severance and transformation expenses as we took decisive actions during the quarter to accelerate and bring forward cost reduction initiatives, which includes the reduction of over 12% of our headquarters' workforce as well…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/01/flowserve-corp-fls-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2020-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"And then on the pump side, we're not seeing -- we don't have as many stocking distributors, a lot of that more is pass-through and they hold just a little bit of inventory, so I don't think there is a big impact on the pump side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"We continue to track ahead of our $100 million cost-out program for full-year 2020, compared to last year's cost structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"While these are not the results we typically expect from the business, I am confident that our focus on execution, cost reduction, backlog conversion and inventory reduction will drive fourth quarter margins above their second and third quarter levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/flowserve-corp-fls-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amy B. Schwetz","x":"…COVID disruption, absorption and mix headwinds, the full year and fourth quarter were impacted by increased realignment spending of approximately $30 million and $2 million, respectively, to support our structural cost-reduction efforts and to better align the business with current volume levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FLS 2020 Q4","e":"fls","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amy B. Schwetz","x":"…tendered, other significant cash usage in 2020 included the return of $136 million to shareholders through dividends and share repurchases, $57 million in capital expenditures and the funding of our structural cost-out actions as well as in our other realignment and transformation programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/flowserve-corp-fls-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FLS 2021 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"In 2020, the pandemic-driven downturn dictated that we focus heavily on cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FLS 2021 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"We shifted our efforts and accelerated the cost reduction aspects of the transformation last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/flowserve-corp-fls-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"FLS 2021 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2021-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"I'd say our supply chain team is doing a really, really nice job in doing the best we can to accommodate for those price increases with our suppliers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"FLS 2021 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2021-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"When it comes to pricing, we have -- we did announce at the beginning of Q3 a price increase that was pretty holistic across most, if not all, of our products in the portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"FLS 2021 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Ritchie","x":"I'm just curious like is there anything you can continue to do to maybe rightsize the fixed cost structure of the business such that the under-absorption is less of an issue if in fact, it takes longer for original equipment orders to come back?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"FLS 2021 Q2","e":"fls","d":"2021-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"The higher level of bookings and our improved operational performance have provided us the confidence to raise our outlook further for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/flowserve-corporation-fls-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"FLS 2021 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"To address the accelerating inflation that we saw during the third quarter, we have now announced our fourth price increase of the year, which will go into effect at the end of this year to continue our efforts to offset the increased costs on purchase items and logistics in the marketplace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/flowserve-corporation-fls-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"FLS 2021 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"R. Scott Rowe","x":"Now we have announced the fourth price increase, which will go into effect at the end of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/flowserve-corporation-fls-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"FLS 2025 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"The expansion of artificial intelligence, cloud computing, data centers, and broad-scale electrification are creating significant growth for power broadly, and specifically within nuclear power generation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/flowserve-fls-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FLS 2025 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"As global electrification advances and new nuclear capacity expands to meet AI, data center, and energy security demands, we see a growth cycle emerging with nuclear becoming a larger contributor to our business over the next five to ten years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/flowserve-fls-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FLS 2025 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"And you can't talk pricing without tariffs sadly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/flowserve-fls-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FLS 2025 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"And so we've really hammered price in The US on the back of all of the tariff changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/flowserve-fls-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FLS 2025 Q3","e":"fls","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Scott Rowe","x":"I think we've done three or four price increases this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/flowserve-fls-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FLS 2026 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2026-04-30","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Robert Rowe","x":"And so I'd say less of an impact in the European theater.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/flowserve-fls-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FLS 2026 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Rowe","x":"…reflect their continued focus on execution as we delivered strong adjusted operating margin expansion of 230 basis points and adjusted earnings per share growth of 18% and including the net benefit of tariffs and other unanticipated items in the quarter that Amy will discuss in more detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/flowserve-fls-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FLS 2026 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Amy Schwetz","x":"First, EPS included a $0.19 benefit from AEFA tariffs for which we have filed for refunds following the U.S. Supreme Court's decision in February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/flowserve-fls-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FLS 2026 Q1","e":"fls","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Rowe","x":"…say, look, we'r